abstract: "An educational Minecraft mod (Fabric) that rebuilds technology in historical order from stone tools to EUV lithography and AI, with a CC0 map of 630 technologies and their prerequisites (1814 links). Most texts were written by AI and checked against sources; not yet reviewed by human experts."
